				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;">This project explores how augmented reality can support human-centered, collaborative computing.&nbsp; We will create an Embodied Coding Environment for the creation of 3D assets and artwork.&nbsp;</span></p>								</div>
