				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cde1383 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cde1383" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;">This work examines neurocognitive and physiological correlates of empathy, attention, and emotion in order to explore how art museums can cultivate empathic understanding.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
